WHAT THIS IS
------------
A MelonLoader plugin that adds a Korean language patch, a cheat widget, and an
autoplay helper to a copy of the game you already own. It is distributed free of
charge and may not be sold, bundled into a paid product, or put behind a paywall.

WHAT IT DOES NOT CONTAIN
------------------------
No original game text, art, audio, code or assets. The game's English strings are
read out of YOUR installed copy at runtime and written to a git-ignored directory;
the translation file holds only the game's own string keys and the Korean written
for this project. Without a legitimately purchased and installed copy of the game,
there is nothing here to run.

WHAT IT CHANGES ON DISK
-----------------------
Nothing that ships with the game. Installing adds files beside it:

    version.dll                      MelonLoader
    MelonLoader/                     MelonLoader
    Mods/CombolandsMod.dll           this mod
    UserData/Combolands/             locale, font, config

Deleting those four returns the install to stock. No game file is patched,
replaced or rewritten.

RISKS
-----
Cheats and autoplay change live game state. Back up your saves first:

    %USERPROFILE%\AppData\LocalLow\Crux Games\Combolands\

